  "ruleText": "Lab 502.02 \"Carrier\" means the duly licensed insurance company which, pursuant to RSA 281-A:5, I and RSA 281-A:6, secures the payment of compensation for an employer subject to the statute.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Lab 502) #5235, eff 9-27-91, EXPIRED: 9-27-97\n\nNew. #6631, INTERIM, eff 11-16-97, EXPIRED: 3-16-98\n\nNew. #6806, eff 7-18-98; ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07\n\nNew. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11067, eff 4-1-16",
